---
title: "JRN-019 Happy Path — Customer Complaint (Standard — Within 3 Business Days)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor PER001 as PER-001<br/>Personal Customer
    actor PER062 as PER-062<br/>Customer Service Agent
    participant Channel as Channel<br/>Web/Mobile Portal (CAP-007)
    participant CAP001 as CAP-001 API<br/>Retail Banking
    participant CAP005 as CAP-005<br/>Compliance
    participant EB as Event Bus<br/>SVC-102

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over PER001,EB: PH-098 — Complaint Receipt and Acknowledgement
        PER001->>Channel: Navigate to Make a Complaint<br/>Enter subject, description, affected product
        Channel->>CAP001: POST /complaints<br/>{ affected_product_type: current_account,<br/>complaint_type: service_failure,<br/>subject: "Incorrect fee charged",<br/>description: "Monthly fee applied twice in March 2026" }
        Note over CAP001: Create ENT-061 ComplaintCase (status: received)<br/>complaint_reference: COMP-20260415-0042
        CAP001-->>Channel: 201 Created { complaint_id, complaint_reference: COMP-20260415-0042,<br/>acknowledgement_message }
        Channel-->>PER001: "Complaint received. Reference: COMP-20260415-0042.<br/>We will respond within 3 business days."
        CAP001->>EB: Publish EVT-138 ComplaintReceived<br/>{ complaint_id, complaint_reference: COMP-20260415-0042,<br/>product_category: current_account }
        EB-)CAP005: Consume EVT-138 → Increment DISP counter for current_account<br/>Create ENT-062 DisCaseSummary entry
        Note over EB: Route EVT-138 → Notifications (SVC-053):<br/>Dispatch acknowledgement notification to customer<br/>Route EVT-138 → Audit (SVC-103):<br/>Write immutable audit record (DISP 1.9.1R)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over PER062,EB: PH-099 — Complaint Triage and Assignment
        PER062->>Channel: Open internal portal → review complaint queue → select complaint
        Channel->>CAP001: PATCH /complaints/{complaint_id}<br/>{ category: billing_error, severity: low,<br/>assigned_to: PER-062,<br/>target_resolution_date: 2026-04-18 }
        Note over CAP001: Update ENT-061 ComplaintCase:<br/>category: billing_error | severity: low<br/>assigned_to: PER-062 | regulated_flag: false
        CAP001->>EB: Publish EVT-139 ComplaintTriaged<br/>{ complaint_id, category: billing_error,<br/>severity: low, regulated_flag: false }
        EB-)CAP005: Consume EVT-139 → No enhanced monitoring required (regulated_flag: false)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
        Note over PER062,EB: PH-100 — Investigation and Resolution
        PER062->>Channel: Review account history and transactions<br/>Determine outcome: upheld, redress £25
        Channel->>CAP001: PATCH /complaints/{complaint_id}<br/>{ outcome: upheld, redress_amount: 25.00,<br/>investigation_notes: "Fee charged twice on 2026-03-01. Credit issued." }
        Note over CAP001: Update ENT-061: outcome: upheld | redress_amount: £25.00<br/>Apply account credit of £25.00
        CAP001->>EB: Publish EVT-140 ComplaintResolved<br/>{ complaint_id, outcome: upheld, redress_amount: "25.00" }
        EB-)CAP005: Consume EVT-140 → Update DisCaseSummary: complaints_upheld++
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over PER062,EB: PH-101 — Response Communication and Closure
        PER062->>Channel: Approve Summary Resolution Communication → dispatch
        Channel->>CAP001: POST /complaints/{complaint_id}/close<br/>{ response_type: summary_resolution_communication }
        Note over CAP001: Update ENT-061 ComplaintCase (status: closed)<br/>elapsed: 1 day | response_type: summary_resolution_communication
        CAP001->>EB: Publish EVT-141 ComplaintClosed<br/>{ complaint_id, response_type: summary_resolution_communication,<br/>elapsed_days: 1 }
        EB-)CAP005: Consume EVT-141 → complaints_closed++; update median_resolution_days
        Note over EB: Route EVT-141 → Notifications (SVC-053):<br/>Dispatch Summary Resolution Communication to customer<br/>Route EVT-141 → Audit (SVC-103):<br/>Write immutable closure audit record
        Note over PER001: Journey complete<br/>ComplaintCase.status: closed<br/>Outcome: upheld | Redress: £25.00 credited<br/>Elapsed: 1 day (within 3-day SLA)
    end
